Could you take a look to the following program :

df <- data.frame(id = factor(rep(1:4, each = 100)), value1 = rep(1:100, 4), value2 = rnorm(400), gr1 = rep(rep(letters[1:2], each = 50), 4), gr2 = rep(LETTERS[1:2], each = 200))

