Subject: geom_segment with a discrete variable
Message-ID: <Fgo1RnaUm9Q.OLvkvSWjQZIJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/ggplot2/c/Fgo1RnaUm9Q/m/OLvkvSWjQZIJ>
