That's been sitting on my to do list for a long time, but I've never
needed it so I haven't made any progress on it.  The drawing part
should be pretty easy - as always, it's the legends that are really
hard.  If you want to have a go at writing your own geom, I'd
recommend looking at the source for geom_point.  There's only one
method you really need to implement - draw().

