Like this?

ggplot(d,aes(x=x,y=y,shape=z1, fill=z2)) +
  geom_point() +
  scale_shape_manual(values = 22:25)

The default legend isn't very good though.  You can hack around it with:

GeomPoint$default_aes <- function(.) aes(shape=22, colour="black",
size=2, fill = NA, alpha = 1)
ggplot(d,aes(x=x,y=y,shape=z1, fill=z2)) +
  geom_point() +
  scale_shape_manual(values = 22:25)

